{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0374"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge literature/modern-lit","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/literature__modern-lit.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",70],["-","five"],["+","six"],["=",479],["-","novels."],["+","novels, although his creator came to dislike him: by 1960 Agatha Christie was calling him a “detestable, bombastic, tiresome, ego-centric little creep”."],["=",369],["+","Half a century later the detective became a psychologist. James Patterson's thriller \"Along Came a Spider\" (1993; German „Morgen Kinder wird’s was geben“) introduced Alex Cross, a forensic psychologist and homicide detective in Washington, D.C., who hunts a kidnapper of two children from a private school. Cross returned in more than two dozen novels, and Morgan Freeman played him twice on screen, in \"Kiss the Girls\" (1997) and in \"Along Came a Spider\" (2001).\n\n"],["=",169],["+","\n| Alex Cross | James Patterson | \"Along Came a Spider\" | 1993 |"],["=",5],["-","them"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","classic five "],["=",99]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",64],["-","fünf"],["+","sechs"],["=",455],["-","auftreten."],["+","auftreten, obwohl seine Schöpferin ihn mit der Zeit nicht mehr ausstehen konnte: 1960 nannte Agatha Christie ihn einen „abscheulichen, pompösen, ermüdenden, egozentrischen kleinen Widerling“."],["=",343],["+","Ein halbes Jahrhundert später wurde der Detektiv zum Psychologen. James Pattersons Thriller „Morgen Kinder wird’s was geben“ (1993; Originaltitel \"Along Came a Spider\") führte Alex Cross ein, einen forensischen Psychologen und Mordermittler in Washington, D.C., der den Entführer zweier Kinder einer Privatschule jagt. Cross kehrte in mehr als zwei Dutzend Romanen zurück, und Morgan Freeman spielte ihn zweimal im Kino, in „… denn zum Küssen sind sie da“ (1997) und in „Im Netz der Spinne“ (2001).\n\n"],["=",167],["+","\n| Alex Cross | James Patterson | „Morgen Kinder wird’s was geben“ | 1993 |"],["=",3],["-","sie"],["+","die"],["=",1],["+","klassischen fünf "],["=",83]]}]},
